  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SampleInfoPanel
  title: "Test03 \xB7 Sprites with physics components"
  description: GameObjects with a Sprite Renderer, Physics Pose and Physics Area Sprite. W / P toggle the two transform write switches, R drops again.
  apiUsed:
  - Physics Pose component (PhysicsPose)
  - Physics Area Sprite component (PhysicsAreaSprite)
  - pose.body (the PhysicsBody behind a Pose)
  - PhysicsWorld.transformWriteMode (Off / Fast2D)
  - PhysicsBody.transformWriteMode (Off / Interpolate)
  - body.position, linearVelocity, angularVelocity
